WEBVTT

00:06:26.249 --> 00:06:30.553
They're bad, but not completely abstract.

00:06:30.587 --> 00:06:33.089
On my arm is my CGM.

00:06:33.857 --> 00:06:38.295
It has saved my life
more times than I can count.

00:06:38.728 --> 00:06:42.399
Knows my blood sugar
every second of every day.

00:06:42.966 --> 00:06:45.936
And knows what I need, even when I don't.

00:06:46.603 --> 00:06:51.174
It has the most obnoxious beeping noise --

00:06:51.207 --> 00:06:54.377
think: worse than a fire alarm --

00:06:54.377 --> 00:06:56.346
for when my blood sugar is low.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.950
And when that alarm goes off
in the middle of the night,

00:06:59.983 --> 00:07:02.819
I would kill for it to have
a snooze button.